# Build / verification reports.
# dogfood-results.json and workflow-verify-report.json are publish evidence and
# are committed on purpose — PR triage requires them, and they are the only
# record of what the structural gates said about the tree that shipped. The
# generated template ignored them, which is why this CLI first arrived without
# either file. apify-actor-audit-report.json stays ignored: this CLI is not
# actor-backed, so its report carries no signal.
/apify-actor-audit-report.json
# Archived run manuscripts (may contain client data)
/.manuscripts/
